 5907|  21.9k|        // the pair is itself a fusable condition: the negation of the first.
 5908|  21.9k|        // It is recorded with that instruction's start position, so a branch
 5909|  21.9k|        // consuming this `i32.eqz` rewinds both away and emits a single fused
